{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a festive autumn with this Japanese-style seasonal set!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes Wa Nation-inspired outfits, themed gear, and traditional sweets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock new kitchen recipes to cook up your own festive foods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be purchased at shops in Yano Market and Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the spirit of the autumn festival to your Elnea adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guiding Butterfly Yukata, Ihm Junior Yukata, Modern Yukata: Vermilion, Modern Kids' Yukata: Vermilion, Modern Yukata: Violet, Modern Kids' Yukata: Violet</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbEquipment</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Kagari Accouterments on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striped Butterfly Waistband, Old-Fashioned Beret: Vermilion, Ihm Mask: Worn Sideways</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbSweets</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Warm 'n' Toasty Grill in Yano Market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moff Candy, Tropical Shaved Ice</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbFestival Food Recipe</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New food recipes will be added to your kitchen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rago Skewer, Escargua Skewer, Baked Poto, Baby Cakes, Candied Pom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b This content can only be purchased once per account.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b If you uninstall the DLC after saving, that save data will no longer be loadable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The base game (sold separately) is required to use this content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please ensure your game is updated to the latest version if necessary.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828660?t=1755653390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3828660?t=1755653390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828660/61d2f6329cafd461a220370e9a09b7d61c1e1bfe/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755653390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3828660/61d2f6329cafd461a220370e9a09b7d61c1e1bfe/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755653390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Celebrate a festive autumn with this Japanese-style seasonal set!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes Wa Nation-inspired outfits, themed gear, and traditional sweets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also unlock new kitchen recipes to cook up your own festive foods.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be purchased at shops in Yano Market and Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring the spirit of the autumn festival to your Elnea adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC includes the following items:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u30fbOutfits</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Available at Matsuri Apparel on Castle St.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guiding Butterfly Yukata, Ihm Junior Yukata, Modern Yukata: Vermilion, Modern Kids' Yukata: Vermilion, Modern Yukata: Violet, Modern Ki